      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOUSIE BOB (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Last start finished 6th on July 31 over 400m at this track behind Skinny Marie beaten 6 lengths (23.45) in a Grade 5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. IT'S A GLAM (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with nine wins and six minors from 21 tries. Was out of the placings last time (30.42) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 2 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. NOVEL (2) was a big winner two back scoring by half a length then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 6 lengths at Gosford (22.53). Form from her last run is proving strong. Winning chance. AT THE GATE (4) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
